// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3398265665" "You've performed admirably, {HeroName}. Neuron's tower has been disabled, preventing Cole from launching his attack before <i>we're</i> ready for it. Longbow has been made aware of your actions and are in your debt, though some still doubt the word of a Praetorian. In due time, I am sure they will all come around.<br><br>As for myself, I have one last task to ask of you before you move on. One that will ensure the help of a group called <color yellow>Vanguard</color>."

